00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.200
an overview of what
is Cloud Composer?

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.410
What kind of problem
we're trying to solve,

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:44.280
and what are some of the
features in Cloud Composer?

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.950
And then we'll follow
